msgstr "略過"

#: src/pages.py:341
msgid "The firmware settings could not be opened on this computer."
msgstr "無法在此電腦上開啟韌體設定。"

#: src/pages.py:354
msgid ""
"To enable it, open the UEFI firmware settings and look under Boot, Security,"
" or Secure Boot. Select Microsoft & 3rd-party CA or turn Secure Boot on. "
"Firmware wording varies by manufacturer."
msgstr ""
"要啟用此功能，請開啟 UEFI 韌體設定，並查看「開機」、「安全性」或「Secure Boot」選項。請選擇「Microsoft 及第三方 CA」或開啟"
" Secure Boot。不同製造商的韌體用詞可能有所不同。"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

msgid "Keep Windows or other partitions, reuse or create an ESP, and design Root and Swap partitions with exact sizes."
msgstr "保留 Windows 或其他分割區，重用或建立 ESP，並精確規劃 Root 及 Swap 分割區的大小。"

msgid "Manual changes are destructive. Existing partition starts are never moved. Plain NTFS can be shrunk only after strict safety checks; encrypted, mounted or unclean volumes are never resized."
msgstr "Manual changes are destructive. Existing partition starts are never moved. Plain NTFS can be shrunk only after strict safety checks; encrypted, mounted or unclean volumes are never resized."

msgid "Install Alongside Automatically"
msgstr "自動並排安裝"

